flowchart TD
    CHURCH[Church tenant] --> SERMON[Sermon with source provenance]
    SERMON --> SERIES[Weekly series with explicit sermon links]
    SERIES --> SLOT[Dated slot with local calendar intent]
    SLOT --> PLAN[Plan identity and immutable revisions]
    PLAN --> PLANREVIEW[Independent plan review]
    PLANREVIEW --> PLANAPPROVED[Exact approved plan hash]
    PLANAPPROVED --> CONTENT[Explicit manual or AI-assisted content draft]
    CONTENT --> CONTENTREVIEW[Independent content review]
    CONTENTREVIEW --> CONTENTAPPROVED[Content approval binds content and plan hashes]
    CONTENTAPPROVED --> SCHEDULE[Schedule pins approved current content head]
    SCHEDULE --> PUBLICATION[Unique publication and live pointer]
    PUBLICATION --> ENGAGEMENT[Engagement tied to viewed publication]
    PUBLICATION --> DELIVERY[Consent-checked external delivery]
    PLAN --> PLANEDIT[Edit creates new Draft and cancels pending schedules]
    CONTENT --> CONTENTEDIT[Edit creates new Draft and cancels pending schedule]
    CONTENTEDIT --> RETAIN[Prior published pointer stays until approved replacement]
    PLANEDIT --> RETAIN
